## Do Not Edit (Generated Paths)

| Path | Generated by |
|---|---|
| `static/style.css` | `TailwindPlugin` |
| `optimized/` | `imageOptimizer` |
| `optimized/manifest.json` | `imageOptimizer` |
| `.frame-master/` | Frame Master core (build output, type declarations, preload) |

